<title>USA: International Lottery Q4 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>International Lottery Q4 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>(thousands of dollars except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				   3	   3	   12	    12</p>
<p>			    MONTHS    MONTHS     MONTHS	MONTHS</p>
<p>			     ENDED     ENDED     ENDED	 ENDED</p>
<p>			 DEC. 31,   DEC. 31,    DEC. 31    DEC. 31,</p>
<p>				1996     1995	 1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenue		  $1,801    $5,213    $16,594     $18,641</p>
<p> Operating loss     ( 2,334)  ( 2,771)  B( 6,894)  A( 14,221)</p>
<p> Net loss	     ( 1,949)  ( 2,645)  B( 5,498)  A( 13,869)</p>
<p> Loss per share	( 0.11)   ( 0.16)    ( 0.31)     ( 0.83)</p>
<p>A) Includes costs related to the unwinding of the Russian lottery project and a $4.2 million reserve recorded for costs associated with the proposed settlement of a shareholders' class action lawsuit.</p>
<p>B) Includes a $2.8 million reserve recorded against the United Kingdom lottery service project.</p>
<p>Full co name is International Lottery &amp; Totalizator Systems Inc.</p>
